Wrong (A): Inquiring whether financial statements are prepared in accordance with the applicable framework is a standard review inquiry under AR-C 90.32.
Wrong (B): Inquiring about subsequent events that could affect the financial statements is an appropriate review procedure under AR-C 90.32.
